Package: atml
Version: 1.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3
Recommends: python3-tk
Maintainer: ATML contributors <atml@example.com>
Description: ATML template compiler CLI, HTML converter runtime, and editor support
 Installs /usr/bin/atml, /usr/share/atml (compiler, runtime, examples,
 syntaxes), a .atml MIME type and desktop entry.
 .
 Build with: dpkg-deb --build installer/debian atml_1.1.0_all.deb
  (layout: installer/debian/DEBIAN/control, installer/debian/usr/...).
